Error [E0041]: `Mutex` is not in Jet; share data through channels
  --> tests/ui/mutex_teaching.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     Mutex(42)
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: Jet avoids shared mutable state: tasks communicate by sending messages, not sharing memory
 Fix: import `core.tasks as tasks`, create a channel, and use `sender.send`/`channel.receive`
